l, "display_name": "Ape Skate Shootout", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "ape", "skate", "hangout"], "long_description": "Shoot. Skate. Toot. \n\nCome hang out at the Skate Park, where you can slide down half pipes and pull off sweet tricks while hanging out with your friends - and grab a gun to mow them down. \n\nIn Ape Skate Shootout you can : \n- Complete skateboard tricks and stunts to earn SkateCash, used to upgrade your character or the Skate Park itself\n- Charge your farts observing your gas meter, and use them to boost around the Skate Park (or to disrespect your fallen foes). \n- Find a variety of weapons to mow down other players and compete in tense deathmatches\n- Combine wacky gadgets and upgrade combos to become the sickest Ape on the half-pipe. \n- Private and public lobby codes to join friends easier\n\nFeaturing a unique locomotion system that's easy to learn and difficult to master, and simple gunplay mechanics with a varied upgrade system, every match of Ape Skate Shootout will feel completely different. ", "short_description": "Kick Ass and Pass Gas - Shoot, skate and toot your way around the Skate Park pulling off tricks and eliminating your opponents. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/ad552715-25ba-47ff-bae9-ba4e3a89f3a7", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Soaring Roc Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.soaringrocstudio.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], 